        dc:contributor      "Edited: May, B, 2013-09-28" , "Reviewed: Niskanen, Einari, 2018-08-08" , "Reviewed: Niskanen, Einari, 2018-05-09" , "GOC:reactome_curators" , "Authored: May, B, 2013-09-28" ;
